    <tr><td><strong>Esc monthly exceeds Standard monthly</strong></td><td style="text-align:right;font-weight:900;color:#047857">${intersectionEscPayVsStdPay ? `Age ${intersectionEscPayVsStdPay}` : "Beyond 95"}</td><td style="color:#475569;font-size:8.5px">Age at which your monthly Escalating cheque exceeds the fixed Standard amount.</td></tr>
